{"speciesId":186,"names":{"fr":"Tarpaud","es":"Politoed","en":"Politoed","ja":"ニョロトノ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"If POLIWAG and POLIWHIRL hear its echoing cry, they respond by gather­ ing from far and wide."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Whenever three or more of these get together, they sing in a loud voice that sounds like bellowing."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"When it expands its throat to croak out a tune, nearby POLIWAG and POLIWHIRL gather immediately."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"The curled hair on POLITOED’s head is proof of its status as a king. It is said that the longer and more curled the hair, the more respect this POKéMON earns from its peers."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"The curled hair on POLITOED’s head is proof of its status as a king. It is said that the longer and more curled the hair, the more respect this POKéMON earns from its peers."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"The curled hair on its head proves its status as a king. It is said that the longer and curlier the hair, the more respect it earns from its peers."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Whenever three or more of these get together, they sing in a loud voice that sounds like bellowing."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"If POLIWAG and POLIWHIRL hear its echoing cry, they respond by gathering from far and wide."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It gathers groups of others as their leader. Its cries make POLIWAG obey."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It gathers groups of others as their leader. Its cries make POLIWAG obey."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It gathers groups of others as their leader. Its cries make POLIWAG obey."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"If POLIWAG and POLIWHIRL hear its echoing cry, they respond by gathering from far and wide."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Whenever three or more of these get together, they sing in a loud voice that sounds like bellowing."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il rassemble ses pairs pour les commander. Il utilise son cri pour diriger Ptitard."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It gathers groups of others as their leader. Its cries make Poliwag obey."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il rassemble ses pairs pour les commander. Il utilise son cri pour diriger Ptitard."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It gathers groups of others as their leader. Its cries make Poliwag obey."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It gathers groups of others as their leader. Its cries make Poliwag obey."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It gathers groups of others as their leader. Its cries make Poliwag obey."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Quand trois ou plus se réunissent, ils chantent d’une même voix ressemblant à un beuglement."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando tres o más de estos se juntan, emiten un sonido muy fuerte parecido a un bramido."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Whenever three or more of these get together, they sing in a loud voice that sounds like bellowing."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"３匹以上 ニョロトノが 集まると かならず 怒鳴るような 鳴き声で 合唱を はじめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Si Ptitard et Têtarte entendent son cri, ils se rassemblent pour venir le rencontrer."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Si Poliwag y Poliwhirl oyen su llanto, acudirán de todas partes para consolarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"If Poliwag and Poliwhirl hear its echoing cry, they respond by gathering from far and wide."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"鳴き声が 響きわたると あちこちから ニョロモや ニョロゾたちが 集まってくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le cheveu bouclé sur la tête de Tarpaud est la preuve de son statut de roi. On raconte que plus son cheveu est long et bouclé, plus ce Pokémon est respecté par ses semblables."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"El mechón rizado de Politoed confirma su condición de rey. Dicen que cuanto más le crece y más se le riza, mayor es el respeto que recibe de sus súbditos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The curled hair on Politoed’s head is proof of its status as a king. It is said that the longer and more curled the hair, the more respect this Pokémon earns from its peers."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"頭の 巻き毛は 王者の 証だ。 長く きれいに 巻いている ニョロトノほど 仲間の 尊敬を 集めると いわれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Le cheveu bouclé sur la tête de Tarpaud est la preuve de son statut de roi. On raconte que plus son cheveu est long et bouclé, plus ce Pokémon est respecté par ses semblables."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"El mechón rizado de Politoed confirma su condición de rey. Dicen que cuanto más le crece y más se le riza, mayor es el respeto que recibe de sus súbditos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The curled hair on Politoed’s head is proof of its status as a king. It is said that the longer and more curled the hair, the more respect this Pokémon earns from its peers."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"頭の 巻き毛は 王者の 証だ。 長く きれいに 巻いている ニョロトノほど 仲間の 尊敬を 集めると いわれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ils se regroupent sous la lune pour chanter. Leur musique est très bruyante et s’apparente à une dispute, mais certains esthètes l’apprécient."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se reúnen bajo la luz de la luna para cantar a coro. No es la más bonita de las melodías, pues parecen estar enfadados, pero tiene su encanto."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"They gather on moonlit nights to form a large chorus. Their cries sound angry and not at all pleasant, but they are certainly distinctive."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"月夜に 集まり 大合唱。 その鳴き声は 怒鳴り声のようで 美しくはないが 味が あるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Les Ptitard et Têtarte lui obéissent. Il n’a qu’à donner de la voix pour les faire trembler comme des feuilles."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Lidera a Poliwag y a Poliwhirl. Cuando Politoed emite un bramido, todos se esconden en el acto asustados."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It’s the leader of Poliwag and Poliwhirl. When Politoed roars, they all cower in fear."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ニョロモや ニョロゾの リーダー。 ニョロトノが 一喝 すると 皆 怯えて その場に 伏せる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Bien que le chant de ce Pokémon s’apparente à des cris, un musicien s’en est inspiré pour composer une magnifique ballade."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"A pesar de lo discordante de sus gritos, un autor se inspiró en ellos para componer una hermosa balada."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although its cries sound like screams, a composer created a beautiful ballad that was influenced by the sounds."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"がなるような 鳴き声なのに とある 作曲家は 影響を 受けて 美しい バラードを 作った。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La longueur et la beauté du cheveu bouclé qui orne la tête de Tarpaud influencent directement le nombre de Ptitard et de Têtarte lui obéissant."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Cuanto más largo y magnífico sea el rizo que luce en la cabeza, más Poliwag y Poliwhirl se someterán a su mandato."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"The longer and more luxurious the curled hair on its head, the greater the number of Poliwag and Poliwhirl that will obey it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"頭の 巻き毛が 長く 立派な ニョロトノほど 多くの ニョロモや ニョロゾを 従えている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il apparaît sur les rives des étangs à la nuit tombée. Il marque son territoire en poussant des hurlements."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Aparece a orillas de las charcas al caer la noche. Reclama su territorio profiriendo un fuerte grito que recuerda a un bramido."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"At nightfall, these Pokémon appear on the shores of lakes. They announce their territorial claims by letting out cries that sound like shouting."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"夜になると 池の 畔に 現れる。 怒鳴るような 声で 鳴いて 縄張りを アピールするぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Le cri des mâles est plus puissant que celui des femelles, qui préfèrent les voix fortes et intimidantes."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Los machos emiten gritos muy potentes. Las hembras sienten predilección por los de voz grave e imponente."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The cry of a male is louder than that of a female. Male Politoed with deep, menacing voices find more popularity with the opposite gender."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"オスのほうが 鳴き声が 大きい。 低く 凄みのある 声で 鳴く ニョロトノが メスに 好かれる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":186,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",1],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"egg",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","lea